            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If a retired employee's or dependent's other health care coverage was not through COBRA, the coverage loss must be due to loss of eligibility for that health care coverage (including from divorce, death, termination of employment, or reduction in hours of employment) or termination of employer contributions toward such coverage.",
            "block_bbox": [
