        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A retired employee will not be able to make dependent enrollment changes until the next annual enrollment period unless the retired employee experiences one of the qualified changes in status described in this section. Any change in enrollment must be consistent with the change in status. To be consistent, the event must cause the retired employee or family member to gain or lose eligibility for the Company-sponsored health care coverage or health care coverage sponsored by a spouse's or dependent child's employer, and the election change must be on account of and correspond with the gain or loss of eligibility. Qualified changes in status include the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                100,
